# VS Code REST Client syntax. Set environment variables before starting your IDE.
# Never paste a real key/token/code into this file or commit it.
# Execute requests individually. Send a game code only with the player's consent.
@baseUrl = https://mlbb-stats.ru/api/v1
@apiKey = {{$processEnv MLBB_API_KEY}}
@token = {{$processEnv MLBB_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@playerKey = 12345678-1234
@challengeId = {{$processEnv MLBB_CHALLENGE_ID}}
@code = {{$processEnv MLBB_LOGIN_CODE}}

### Schema, no key required
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### 1. Send code. Replace BOTH numeric IDs with the consenting player's IDs.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-code
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerId":12345678,"serverId":1234}

### 2. Verify. Set MLBB_CHALLENGE_ID and MLBB_LOGIN_CODE privately.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"challengeId":"{{challengeId}}","code":"{{code}}"}

### 3. Basic profile, no player token required
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}?fields=name,avatar,currentRank.stars
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4. Profile with selected statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}?include=stats&fields=name,stats.games,stats.winRate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Overall metrics, Ranked mode
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}/stats?mode=ranked
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 6. Season summaries, page 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}/seasons?limit=50&offset=0
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. One season; historical detail requires owner + active Premium
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}/seasons/42?mode=ranked
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Top heroes
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}/heroes?limit=3&sort=-games&fields=heroId,nameRu,games,winRate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 9. One hero; optional ?season=42&mode=ranked
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerKey}}/heroes/1
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10. Current player session. Set MLBB_ACCESS_TOKEN from auth/verify privately.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Revoke THIS API session (204, no JSON body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
